Position-independent compiler-rt builtins for riscv32-unknown-elf, RV32IMAC
with Zicsr and Zifencei, using the ILP32 soft-float ABI. The common freestanding
producer builds the archive from the shared LLVM version and complete runtime
patch set, without an application sysroot or target libc.

The package installs the archive in Clang's canonical target resource
directory. Firmware consumers explicitly link this archive; the package
does not provide a libc, C++ runtime, operating system SDK, or firmware.
